  "prompt": "How many units were sold in each ISO week that has order lines in February 2025? Use the sales table and its order_week column, the Monday that starts an order's ISO week. Count only order lines dated from 1 February 2025 to 28 February 2025, both days included, even when their week started in January. Return two columns, in this order: order_week and units_sold, the sum of units. Return one row per order_week, sorted by order_week from earliest to latest. Order lines with missing units add nothing to the total.",
